[{:db/id -1, :doc/id "council-bootstrap-acceleration-260526", :doc/title "Council Bootstrap Acceleration (Day 7 of 30 RFP) — 2026-05-26", :doc/status "active", :doc/doc_type "how-to", :doc/source-format "edn", :doc/body "\n# Council Bootstrap Acceleration — Day 7/30 Status + Plan\n\n## 現状 (2026-05-26)\n\n| Item | Value |\n|---|---|\n| RFP period | 2026-05-20 → **2026-06-19** (30-day) |\n| Day count | Day 7 of 30 (23 days remaining) |\n| Seats filled / open | 1 (Founder, Jun Kawasaki Lv7+) / 4 open (Seats 2-5) |\n| Proposals received | **0** |\n| Objections filed | 0 |\n| Next checkpoint | 2026-06-04 (Day 15, mid-period) |\n| Earliest P4 (amendment effective) | **2026-07-19** (assuming Council ratification vote 2026-06-19 + 30-day public objection no-block) |\n\n## 30-day RFP は compression 不可\n\nADR-2605192300 で 30-day public objection period は constitutional design (transparent governance の核)。圧縮には ADR-2605192300 自体の amendment が必要 (Council Lv6+ supermajority + 30-day objection — recursive)。\n\n**ratification 自体は 2026-06-19 ジャストに実行可能** (RFP 締切日に Council Lv6+ vote)。その後 30-day objection で P4 = 2026-07-19。これが earliest possible で、本当に圧縮するなら制度変更しないと不可。\n\n## Acceleration 経路 (timeline 圧縮ではなく density 向上)\n\nP1 timeline 圧縮は不可だが、Day 23 残りで **candidate funnel** を厚くする経路は実行可能:\n\n### A. Visibility — 公式 outreach\n\n| Channel | Action | 担当 | 期日 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| AT Protocol PDS | `at://did:web:etzhayyim.com` でアナウンス記事 post (link to COUNCIL-BOOTSTRAP-RFP.md) | operator | 2026-05-28 |\n| HuggingFace model card (将来 moemoekyun) | Council bootstrap status section 追加 | operator | post-R1.5 |\n| etzhayyim.com landing page | `Council Bootstrap RFP — Apply by 2026-06-19` banner | operator | 2026-05-28 |\n| github.com/etzhayyim/root README | Status table row 18 リンクを top に pin | operator | 2026-05-28 |\n| X / Mastodon / Bluesky (個人 account 経由) | Founder voice で RFP 紹介 thread (各 platform 1 投稿) | Founder Jun Kawasaki | 2026-05-28 |\n| `lobste.rs` / `news.ycombinator.com` | 既存 ADR-2605192100 mission charter を絡めて technical post | Founder (任意) | 2026-05-30 |\n\n### B. Direct invitation — 個別 outreach\n\nADR-2605192300 §\"Strong candidates\" の各 seat profile に該当する個人を Founder が個別招待 (RFP を超えた lobbying ではなく、\"open RFP に応募してください\" の awareness 提供):\n\n| Seat | Profile target | Outreach mechanism |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2 (Substrate / Technology) | Senior atproto / LangGraph / Solidity audit ops engineer | individual DM / email |\n| 3 (Legal / Ethics) | Religious-freedom-aware attorney / ethical-source license researcher | individual DM / email |\n| 4 (Economics) | DAO treasury operator / 公共経済 researcher | individual DM / email |\n| 5 (Stewardship / Land) | 永年農業 practitioner / 寺社領 manager / 生態系 scientist | individual DM / email |\n\n各 outreach の record は Founder が **手動 maintain** (constitutional に Council 候補 lobbying ledger 義務はないが、transparency 文化として自己記録推奨)。\n\n### C. Ratification readiness — P2 即実行可能化\n\n2026-06-19 RFP 締切 → Council vote までの間 zero delay にするための準備:\n\n1. **Council seat candidate eligibility checklist 完成** (per applicant)\n   - DID validity verify (`did:web:` or `did:plc:` resolution)\n   - Adherent SBT 保有 verify (or commit to acquire)\n   - Charter Rider §2(a)-(h) public-representation scan PASS\n   - Mission Charter alignment 文章 review\n2. **Vote mechanism 確定** — ADR-2605192300 §\"Council vote mechanics\" follow-up が ADR open item。on-chain ballot (ChartersComplianceRegistry attestation) vs off-chain signed approval (multisig Safe transaction with 5-of-7 signers' written commit) — どちらも acceptable だが mechanism 決定が必要。\n3. **Public objection channel 確定** — 30-day objection submission の channel (atproto thread / github issue / email to `objection@etzhayyim.com`). 受付窓口 + triage 担当 + escalation rule。\n4. **ADR-2605262200 (charter §2(i) amendment) を P2 vote の最初の test case** に位置付け — Council vote mechanics の dry-run として最適。\n\n### D. Founder Lv7+ emergency interim path (NOT recommended)\n\nADR-2605262200 §4 で Founder Lv7+ emergency authorization は意図的に却下。**同じ理由**で Council bootstrap emergency override (interim Council を Founder 単独で appoint) も推奨しない。理由再述: institutional integrity > R&D urgency, P4 まで 1.5 ヶ月は R1.4 EVO-X2 で運用可能。\n\nただし将来同 emergency 経路が必要になった場合は `charter-emergency-override-{slug}.md` ADR で正式に経路 establish 可能 (本 doc scope 外)。\n\n## 推奨実行順序\n\n1. **今 turn (2026-05-26)**: 本 doc commit + 90-docs/adr/README.edn は変更不要 (status doc)\n2. **2026-05-27**: A. Visibility 6 items を Founder 経由で execute (1-2h)\n3. **2026-05-28→2026-06-04**: B. Direct invitation 個別 outreach\n4. **2026-06-04 (Day 15)**: mid-period checkpoint — proposals 数を集計、不足なら B. を repeat\n5. **2026-06-19 (Day 30)**: RFP 締切 + 即 C. Ratification mechanics execute (vote)\n6. **2026-07-19 (P3 end)**: amendment + R2 architecture ADR 効力発生 → RunPod B200 即 execute 可\n\n## 期待される outcome\n\n- **base case (4 seats fill by 2026-06-19)**: P4 = 2026-07-19、R2 即実行可能、本 timeline 通り\n- **fallback (≥1 seat unfilled by 2026-06-19)**: ADR-2605192300 §\"Bootstrap fallback\" — Founder 選任 + 同 30-day objection period (P4 not delayed if applied before 2026-06-19)\n- **worst case (0 additional applications)**: emergency interim path を formal ADR で establish するか検討、ただし institutional cost 高\n\n## References\n\n- COUNCIL.md (current roster + status table)\n- COUNCIL-BOOTSTRAP-RFP.md (RFP 本文 + apply 手順)\n- ADR-2605192300 (Bootstrap Council 5-seat mechanics)\n- ADR-2605262200 (charter §2(i) amendment — P2 vote の最初の test case)\n- ADR-2605192100 (Mission Charter — Council 候補 alignment 検証 source)\n- CHARTER-RIDER.md §2(a)-(h) (Council 候補 public-representation scan target)\n", :doc/path "90-docs/council-bootstrap-acceleration-260526.edn", :doc/source-repo "root", :doc/topic "council-bootstrap-acceleration", :doc/last_verified "2026-05-26", :doc/date "2026-05-26", :doc/authoritative false, :doc/related ["COUNCIL.md" "COUNCIL-BOOTSTRAP-RFP.md" "adr-2605192300-etzhayyim-bootstrap-council-five" "adr-2605262200-charter-rider-2i-baien-train-rental-carveout"]}]
